WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.207 --> 00:00:03.230
The space station shook again.

2
00:00:03.231 --> 00:00:07.232
"I thought Furbit was small," Roxy said.

3
00:00:07.233 --> 00:00:10.964
"Furbit was small," Dr. Chen said.

4
00:00:10.965 --> 00:00:14.738
"But he keeps eating—and growing."

5
00:00:14.739 --> 00:00:16.301
Officer Wells nodded.

6
00:00:16.302 --> 00:00:18.525
"The more he eats, the bigger he gets.

7
00:00:18.526 --> 00:00:20.836
He's pretty big now."

8
00:00:20.837 --> 00:00:25.884
He shook his head. "I made a really big mistake!"

9
00:00:25.885 --> 00:00:30.996
Roxy had to find Furbit!

10
00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:33.676
She ran down some stairs.

11
00:00:33.677 --> 00:00:35.948
The space station shook again.

12
00:00:35.949 --> 00:00:38.327
Roxy heard a loud snort.

13
00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:40.492
She hurried toward the sound.

14
00:00:40.493 --> 00:00:42.826
"Rocket Girl!" an astronaut said.

15
00:00:42.827 --> 00:00:44.882
"Thank goodness you're here!

16
00:00:44.883 --> 00:00:46.961
Furbit's in the big storage room.

17
00:00:46.962 --> 00:00:52.718
He's eating everything! Please do something!"

18
00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:57.138
Roxy found the storage room.

19
00:00:57.139 --> 00:00:59.732
She pressed a button, and the doors opened.

20
00:00:59.733 --> 00:01:03.087
She went in and looked around.

21
00:01:03.088 --> 00:01:05.553
A large satellite sat on the floor.

22
00:01:05.554 --> 00:01:08.534
Suddenly a shadow covered everything.

23
00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:12.319
Roxy looked up and gulped.

24
00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:20.004
"Furbit! Furbit!" An enormous, furry creature picked up the satellite.

25
00:01:20.005 --> 00:01:23.188
The creature tossed the satellite into its wide mouth.

26
00:01:23.189 --> 00:01:26.580
Crunch, crunch! Gulp!

27
00:01:26.581 --> 00:01:29.080
Furbit closed his eyes and smiled.

28
00:01:29.081 --> 00:01:35.412
"Hey!" Rocket Girl flew up to the creature's head. "Stop eating stuff!"

29
00:01:35.413 --> 00:01:37.855
Suddenly Furbit looked scared.

30
00:01:37.856 --> 00:01:41.433
The creature swung a big paw at Roxy. Whap!

31
00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:44.038
The paw knocked Roxy across the room.

32
00:01:44.039 --> 00:01:48.165
Bam! Roxy slammed into a wall.

33
00:01:48.166 --> 00:01:51.323
Roxy stamped her foot.

34
00:01:51.324 --> 00:01:53.565
Then she shot back toward Furbit.

35
00:01:53.566 --> 00:01:55.767
"Don't hit me again!"

36
00:01:55.768 --> 00:02:00.856
"Furbit!" The big creature batted Roxy with its other paw.

37
00:02:00.857 --> 00:02:03.864
Again Roxy was thrown across the room.

38
00:02:03.865 --> 00:02:06.976
By now the astronauts were gathered in the doorway.

39
00:02:06.977 --> 00:02:12.331
"Oh no!" Dr. Chen said. "I hope Rocket Girl is okay."

40
00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.075
Roxy was furious.

41
00:02:14.076 --> 00:02:16.861
She got ready to shoot toward the big creature.

42
00:02:16.862 --> 00:02:19.766
But then she stopped herself.

43
00:02:19.767 --> 00:02:22.940
"Maybe Furbit is scared," Roxy thought.

44
00:02:22.941 --> 00:02:25.590
"I'll try to calm him down."

45
00:02:25.591 --> 00:02:29.214
Roxy carefully took a few steps toward the huge creature.

46
00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:32.444
"There, there," she said softly.

47
00:02:32.445 --> 00:02:36.644
"It's okay. I won't hurt you."

48
00:02:36.645 --> 00:02:40.524
Furbit tilted his head. "Furbit?"

49
00:02:40.525 --> 00:02:45.147
Roxy smiled and held out her hand. "Furbit!"

50
00:02:45.148 --> 00:02:48.184
Furbit moved closer to Roxy.

51
00:02:48.185 --> 00:02:52.961
The big creature held out his paw.

52
00:02:52.962 --> 00:02:55.856
Roxy patted his paw.

53
00:02:55.857 --> 00:02:59.536
Furbit purred loudly.

54
00:02:59.537 --> 00:03:02.619
Roxy sighed.

55
00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.080
Then she turned to the astronauts.

56
00:03:05.081 --> 00:03:09.498
"Bring me Furbit's spaceship!"

57
00:03:09.499 --> 00:03:13.520
Officer Wells carried a tiny spaceship into the room.

58
00:03:13.521 --> 00:03:18.495
Roxy groaned. "Furbit can't fit in that!"

59
00:03:18.496 --> 00:03:23.087
Rumble, rumble! Furbit's belly growled.

60
00:03:23.088 --> 00:03:26.084
Roxy looked up at Furbit and sighed.

61
00:03:26.085 --> 00:03:29.520
"You're hungry again? You just—"

62
00:03:29.521 --> 00:03:37.604
"Furbit! Furbit!"

